1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:02,085
I'm fine now

2
00:00:02,211 --> 00:00:03,611
Because I have someone
who misses me

3
00:00:10,385 --> 00:00:11,887
Oh

4
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,960
You're way better
than I expected

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,895
Damn it

6
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:22,773
Gosh

7
00:00:22,898 --> 00:00:24,775
This is unfair

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,609
Why?

9
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:26,735
You kept talking to me

10
00:00:28,487 --> 00:00:29,487
What the heck?

11
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:33,575
It was fun

12
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,161
Right, let's do it
some time again

13
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:37,286
-Great
-Yeah

14
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:46,296
Can I use a bathroom?

15
00:00:46,421 --> 00:00:47,923
Sure, this way

16
00:00:54,221 --> 00:00:56,682
Don't tell me it's true
You with Soobin?

17
00:00:56,807 --> 00:01:00,143
Let's set a meeting
with his agency soon

18
00:01:02,896 --> 00:01:03,522
I like you too

19
00:01:03,647 --> 00:01:05,287
[Lee Hyesung's lover
was not Shin Yoo-il?]

20
00:01:14,574 --> 00:01:16,868
I'm sorry
I got a call from Wonho

21
00:01:16,994 --> 00:01:18,287
Hyesung

22
00:01:18,412 --> 00:01:19,496
I'm sorry, but

23
00:01:22,916 --> 00:01:24,334
I gotta go
to my agency now
